Database Schema:
├─ Posts Table
│  ├─ id: integer
│  ├─ title: string (max 200 chars)
│  ├─ content: string (max 50,000 chars)
│  ├─ author: string
│  ├─ created_at: timestamp
│  ├─ updated_at: timestamp
│  ├─ views: integer (counter)
│  ├─ likes: integer (counter)
│  ├─ tags: array<string>
│  └─ metadata: object
│
├─ Comments Table
│  ├─ id: integer
│  ├─ post_id: integer (foreign key)
│  ├─ content: string
│  ├─ author: string
│  ├─ created_at: timestamp
│  └─ likes: integer
│
└─ User Sessions (optional)
   ├─ session_id: string
   ├─ user_id: integer
   ├─ created_at: timestamp
   └─ expires_at: timestamp

